it":"683113d4baf6febecaf2ccb7913df87c4d68d454","selection_begin":"安世字子孺","selection_end":"戸功次大將軍光","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-hanshu-059-zhangtang","book_id":"b-hanshu-059","work_id":"w-hanshu","source_id":"s-hanshu-059-zhangtang"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p011","text":"元鼎五年秋，丞相有罪，罷。制詔御史：「萬石君先帝尊之，子孫孝，其以御史大夫慶爲丞相，封爲牧丘侯。」是時漢方南誅兩越，東撃朝鮮，北逐匈奴，西伐大宛，中國多事。天子巡狩海内，修上古神祠，封禪，興禮樂。公家用少，桑弘羊等致利，王温舒之屬峻法，兒寬等推文學至九卿，更進用事，事不關決於丞相，丞相醇謹而已。在位九歳，無能有所匡言。嘗欲請治上近臣所忠、九卿咸宣罪，不能服，反受其過，贖罪。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"z6g_h69_eva","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0019","start":19,"end":22,"surface":"萬石君","kind":"person","person_id":"esh_e0a_jrw_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"先帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"慶","kind":"person","person_id":"esh_e0a_jrw_AD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0103","start":103,"end":106,"surface":"桑弘羊","kind":"person","person_id":"fi2_2cl_w22","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0110","start":110,"end":113,"surface":"王温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"兒寬","kind":"person","person_id":"x8r_9sk_d7a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0164","start":164,"end":165,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0167","start":167,"end":169,"surface":"所忠","kind":"person","person_id":"gns_w0b_kfj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m011-0172","start":172,"end":174,"surface":"咸宣","kind":"person","person_id":"oh2_xep_h3c","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi","book_id":"b-shiji-103","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-103-wanshi"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p030","text":"班固稱曰：公孫弘、卜式、兒寬皆以鴻漸之翼困於燕雀，遠跡羊豕之閒，非遇其時，焉能致此位乎？是時漢興六十餘載，海內乂安，府庫充實，而四夷未賓，制度多闕，上方欲用文武，求之如弗及。始以蒲輪迎枚生，見主父而嘆息。群臣慕向，異人并出。卜式試於芻牧，弘羊擢於賈豎，衛青奮於奴仆，日磾出於降虜，斯亦曩時版筑飯牛之朋矣。漢之得人，於茲為盛。儒雅則公孫弘、董仲舒、兒寬，篤行則石建、石慶，質直則汲黯、卜式，推賢則韓安國、鄭當時，定令則趙禹、張湯，文章則司馬遷、相如，滑稽則東方朔、枚皋，應對則嚴助、朱買臣，歷數則唐都、落下閎，協律則李延年，運籌則桑弘羊，奉使則張騫、蘇武，將帥則衛青、霍去病，受遺則霍光、金日磾。其餘不可勝紀。是以興造功業，制度遺文，後世莫及。孝宣承統，纂修洪業，亦講論六藝，招選茂異，而蕭望之、梁丘賀、夏侯勝、韋玄成、嚴彭祖、尹更始以儒術進，劉向、王褒以文章顯。將相則張安世、趙充國、魏相、邴吉、于定國、杜延年，治民則黃霸、王成、龔遂、鄭弘、邵信臣、韓延壽、尹翁歸、趙廣漢之屬，皆有功跡見述於後。累其名臣，亦其次也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_bangu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"班固","kind":"person","person_id":"gxd_15x_9d0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"公孫弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"卜式","kind":"person","person_id":"h6s_hqj_u6k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"兒寬","kind":"person","person_id":"x8r_9sk_d7a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0074","start":74,"end":75,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"枚生","kind":"person","person_id":"e1m_xt0_8w7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"主父","kind":"person","person_id":"vbr_ff1_yc4","status":"contextual_provisional"},